error[SC0104]: this `#line` is not read
   ╭─[ a_nul_a_line_directive_s_name_decodes_is_refused.c:1:1 ]
   │
 1 │ #line 1 "a\0bcdefgh"
   │ ┬  
   │ ╰── directive begins here
───╯
  = note: `"a\0bcdefgh"` names its file with an escape that makes a carriage return, a NUL or a Ctrl-Z, which is not read in a `#line` name
  = note: `#line` is read as a line from 1 to 2147483647 in decimal digits, and a string literal with no prefix after it if it names the file
